From b87cccfa5f7ded059e48e2586f6b22140ae4cfb5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gaoyang Zhang <younglobalization@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 20:31:10 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] vendor(openclaw): surface failed Feishu quote reads

Why:
- Quoted-message API, empty-response, and parse failures otherwise collapse to null, so agents mistake incomplete employee replies for complete context.
- Quoted-message GETs need bounded transient and rate-limit retries before exposing terminal failure.
- Merged-forward quotes carry interactive child cards whose escalation IDs are lost if only the root is selected.

Removal:
- Drop when upstream retries and diagnoses quote reads, preserves an explicit unavailable marker, and expands merged-forward interactive child content.

Tests:
- extensions/feishu/src/send.test.ts
- extensions/feishu/src/bot.test.ts
- apps/desktop/src/cs-bridge/vendor-feishu-escalation-quote.sentinel.test.ts
